
-> Day1Wakeup
=== Day1Wakeup ===
#Belladona
"Oh good, you're awake. Come on don't dally we don't got all the time in the world."

#Belladona
"Are you sentient yet? Can you comprehend sentences?"

#Belladona
"Very well. let's get one thing straight before you start."

#Belladona
"You are still on trial."

#Belladona
"No, yesterday was your sort of induction or onboarding into the business."

#Belladona
"I agreed to take you on if I was given a two day evaluation period."

#Belladona
"Yes, two days to prove you're capable and not going to break my shop, or the order of things here."

#Belladona
"If you impress me, you stay. If you don't...well - I'll just give you back."

#Belladona
"Yes, back. It does not concern me what they do with you afterwards."

#Belladona
"However, I have heard it is particularly...challenging for rejected apprentices."

#Belladona
"No, I will not elaborate."

#Belladona
"So, two days. Make them count."

#Belladona
"Now, today's the day we start real work. There's going to be real souls, real expectations and real consequences."

#Belladona
"And try not to greet them with your...nevermind, I don't think you could change that about yourself - very well."

#Belladona
"When the bell rings, it means there's a soul ready to be served."

#Belladona
"Remember to check your order tab for what they need. Yes, the floating one."

#Belladona
"If something goes wrong, try to think for yourself what to do."

#Belladona
"And if you embarass me, I will have you scrub every inch of this place - yes, including the attic. No, I don't care you're afraid of demons."

#Belladona
"Come see me at the counter when you're ready to start the day."

~ TeleportCat2("Start")

